  {
   "id": "d01_0215",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76.0,
   "y": 1618.5,
   "width": 815.26,
   "height": 135.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp01_002"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1802588,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22516748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Four walls in order: Foundry guardrail (W0, detective), APIM gateway (W1), MCP server (W2), data\n  plane (W3). Each one has its own deny.\n- The private MCP server is reached directly from Foundry, so the APIM kill switch and rate limit do not\n  cover it.\n- Governed data paths carry the user's own identity end to end (T1, T2, then T4 by OBO); the vendor\n  path ends at the gateway, and the legacy path (red) uses a shared key on purpose.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Four walls in order: Foundry guardrail (W0, detective), APIM gateway (W1), MCP server (W2), data\n  plane (W3). Each one has its own deny.\n- The private MCP server is reached directly from Foundry, so the APIM kill switch and rate limit do not\n  cover it.\n- Governed data paths carry the user's own identity end to end (T1, T2, then T4 by OBO); the vendor\n  path ends at the gateway, and the legacy path (red) uses a shared key on purpose.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d01_0217",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 1585.5,
   "width": 307.86,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp01_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1818426,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22726206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Main flow (numbers on the arrows)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Main flow (numbers on the arrows)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d01_0218",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 1618.5,
   "width": 660.72,
   "height": 120.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp01_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1826345,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22830935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. A persona signs in to Entra ID with MFA (the console uses device code on abw-test-client).\n2. The user calls APIM /agents with an Entra token for Foundry (T1); APIM checks it and\n    meters tokens.\n3. APIM forwards to the Foundry Responses API; the user's token is passed on unchanged.\n4. The agent calls a tool: Foundry sends the user's own OAuth token (T2, from a one-time\n    consent) to APIM.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. A persona signs in to Entra ID with MFA (the console uses device code on abw-test-client).\n2. The user calls APIM /agents with an Entra token for Foundry (T1); APIM checks it and\n    meters tokens.\n3. APIM forwards to the Foundry Responses API; the user's token is passed on unchanged.\n4. The agent calls a tool: Foundry sends the user's own OAuth token (T2, from a one-time\n    consent) to APIM.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d01_0219",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1659.0,
   "y": 1618.5,
   "width": 655.34,
   "height": 140.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp01_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1834264,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22935664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5. APIM checks audience, role, client and rate, then forwards to the MCP server (Wall 1).\n6. The MCP server re-checks the token and swaps it for a data-plane token (OBO) using its\n    managed identity (Wall 2).\n7. The MCP server calls Storage, Cosmos or Search as the user; the data plane's own roles\n    allow or deny (Wall 3).\n8. Every hop logs: APIM, MCP and Foundry telemetry flow to Log Analytics; MCP also writes\n    the audit blob.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "5. APIM checks audience, role, client and rate, then forwards to the MCP server (Wall 1).\n6. The MCP server re-checks the token and swaps it for a data-plane token (OBO) using its\n    managed identity (Wall 2).\n7. The MCP server calls Storage, Cosmos or Search as the user; the data plane's own roles\n    allow or deny (Wall 3).\n8. Every hop logs: APIM, MCP and Foundry telemetry flow to Log Analytics; MCP also writes\n    the audit blob.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
